  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Resettlement Assistance to New Zealand Refugee Quota Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will provide the government of New Zealand and quota refugee programme applicants with support for resettlement assistance: logistical assistance to the quota refugee selection missions, movement assistance for case processing, pre-departure assistance, and resettlement travel assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
